1
00:00:01,326 --> 00:00:03,326
== sync, corrected by elderman ==
@elder_man

2
00:00:05,351 --> 00:00:07,351
(Penny:)I'm really happy
you and Amy are back together.

3
00:00:07,353 --> 00:00:08,883
(Sheldon:)Oh, thank you.

4
00:00:08,888 --> 00:00:11,258
(Leonard:)I'm also really happy, but
I can't pretend it's for you.

5
00:00:11,257 --> 00:00:13,357
New Star Wars in three days!

6
00:00:14,327 --> 00:00:16,327
(Sheldon:)Hey, Thursday can't
get here soon enough.

7
00:00:16,329 --> 00:00:18,829
(Sheldon:)I'm taking off work
to watch the original trilogy

8
00:00:18,832 --> 00:00:23,302
while I eat enough Star Wars
cereal to choke a Wookiee.

9
00:00:23,303 --> 00:00:26,803
(Penny:)Uh, sweetie, you do realize
Thursday is Amy's birthday.

10
00:00:26,806 --> 00:00:29,376
(Sheldon:)And you do realize
I bought my ticket

11
00:00:29,375 --> 00:00:31,175
(Sheldon:)when Amy and I were broken up?

12
00:00:32,645 --> 00:00:34,815
(Sheldon:)I hope you didn't need anything
in that case,

13
00:00:34,814 --> 00:00:36,244
(Sheldon:)'cause it's closed.

14
00:00:36,249 --> 00:00:38,619
(Penny:)You guys just got back together.

15
00:00:38,618 --> 00:00:40,788
(Penny:)You might not want
to ditch her on her birthday.

16
00:00:40,787 --> 00:00:43,057
(Leonard:)I think Penny has a point.
You can see it another day.

17
00:00:43,056 --> 00:00:45,056
(Sheldon:)But someone might
spoil the movie.

18
00:00:45,058 --> 00:00:47,128
(Sheldon:)No one can spoil
Amy's birthday for me.

19
00:00:47,126 --> 00:00:48,426
Surprise! She's even older.

20
00:00:48,428 --> 00:00:50,728
(Sheldon:)Who saw that coming?

21
00:00:50,730 --> 00:00:52,530
Oh, that's nice.

22
00:00:52,532 --> 00:00:55,002
(Penny:)Put that on her cake.

23
00:00:57,270 --> 00:01:04,020
(whirring)

